{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://xochi.fi/spec/conformance/shielded-terms.schema.json",
  "title": "Shielded settlement v1 design-A terms, preview and manifest vectors (PROPOSED)",
  "description": "ShieldedTermsV1 (§7 SignedTerms + rail + feePayer, D7 amendment 2026-10-27), the non-signable ShieldedPreviewV1 and the CorridorManifestV1 hashStruct (manifestDigest), with single-member refusals. Generated with ethers primitives, independently of @xochi/signer and Riddler. uint values are decimal strings; bytes/addresses lowercase hex. All digests are distinct.",
